title: "Disuza Quantitative — Public Technical Reference"
abstract: >-
  Living technical reference for Disuza Quantitative, a private
  quantitative trading research laboratory based in Madrid, Spain.
  Covers architecture, methodology (anti-overfit validation pipeline
  per López de Prado: CPCV, Deflated Sharpe Ratio, Probability of
  Backtest Overfitting), data pipelines, execution venues, risk
  framework, and regulatory posture. Source code and model weights
  are proprietary and not included in this repository.
